{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:9/92/dmgdylw2k2rsu63bbm7dtigk337zk8k.mp3","text":"博士？这么好的天气，再稍微睡一会儿好吗~","alt":"voice_cn/char_124_kroos/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:5/54/sud80e546udcon269dvs0izjul2whu4.mp3","text":"嗯？马上要出发？我刚刚起床......顺便问一下，这里是博士的办公室吗？为什么我会在这里呢？","alt":"voice_cn/char_124_kroos/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3b/pkl03hi88y7hqkywu4cc0v35kvkzmsa.mp3","text":"为什么我要眯起眼睛？因为不想让人看到我的眼睛，谁都不让~♪","alt":"voice_cn/char_124_kroos/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fa/e6bkw38ibfiuaxqnuhn4v8fr8b11mfv.mp3","text":"我总是不小心受伤呢~但芙蓉会治好我的，所以我才不怕~啊，不过“治愈料理”是另一回事，那个真是可怕的体验啊......","alt":"voice_cn/char_124_kroos/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a5/lgvh8exw7qey0lo6we92fphlpbgu59j.mp3","text":"博士~！我床头多了十个闹钟~！真是过分的恶作剧~到底是谁放的呢？","alt":"voice_cn/char_124_kroos/cn_005.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f3/h2yteuajf8g9pjvvo96uzya7l47awax.mp3","text":"博士，来玩个游戏吧？头上~放一个红苹果~","alt":"voice_cn/char_124_kroos/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/20/47ntf66awr9cm8f4hjox84d1ixey55i.mp3","text":"我总是在找寻让人开心的事情~也是为了缓和矿石病的痛苦吧。能看到大家开开心心的模样，也是一件快乐的事呀~","alt":"voice_cn/char_124_kroos/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/ec/n31uqcg74rt4iydcle31lij3z9pz0ou.mp3","text":"总有一天，罗德岛的旅途会结束的。要是能和大家一起，在温暖的天气里香甜地睡一觉，做一场醒不来的梦，该有多好啊~这是我最大的梦想哦~","alt":"voice_cn/char_124_kroos/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cd/touc4vi59ajomo9ahoks2p36t1sbkkb.mp3","text":"博士竟然睡得比我还安稳呢......","alt":"voice_cn/char_124_kroos/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:0/00/8znpwc4fjfzqxv4ve6jr6kfjinlymtj.mp3","text":"嗨~嗨~我是克洛丝哦~我还不成熟，从今天开始会加油的~","alt":"voice_cn/char_124_kroos/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:c/ca/rlbjmevatsuju997hnrbwv7salercf7.mp3","text":"谢谢啦~","alt":"voice_cn/char_124_kroos/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c7/97i7r0i7g1im08hkgeibpw0k6hkp9nj.mp3","text":"晋升啦~做了个好梦呢~嗯？不是在梦中吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_124_kroos/cn_013.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:1/16/k94qpyfwn92cai4e08eawgtijkj5ii8.mp3","text":"那个，集合地点在哪呢？","alt":"voice_cn/char_124_kroos/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b7/sp18iw3hucyjy2njso73i9f2f56ddqh.mp3","text":"欸~队长的话还是芬更好吧~","alt":"voice_cn/char_124_kroos/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:2/27/o63m6n4f2mq33mflv4ph13dn8um9d1d.mp3","text":"大家~嗯，可以放松一下哦~","alt":"voice_cn/char_124_kroos/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2f/7995bpkrcdpa45l9rgycjl0h3sta2dz.mp3","text":"为什么，大家不能好好相处呢......？","alt":"voice_cn/char_124_kroos/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6a/insc006gkl007cxgug3xsar8fxq4wwq.mp3","text":"好~","alt":"voice_cn/char_124_kroos/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/97/9kzsa4e99zakkvgsfwduih1vjxrca5j.mp3","text":"慢慢来就好哦~","alt":"voice_cn/char_124_kroos/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b4/1man7jp3rspxmxgg8jszk4rnhw8jccb.mp3","text":"嗯嗯，听着呢~","alt":"voice_cn/char_124_kroos/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/ac/hlxrhx211vv5ds612izn37k1m77td9q.mp3","text":"战斗的时候可是不会睡着的~","alt":"voice_cn/char_124_kroos/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:0/05/n777oowuti4p0os6iahdvur3ppgkxvf.mp3","text":"你在这里~","alt":"voice_cn/char_124_kroos/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/84/j2lecgm9m8a8j6yfkxe1k3vq8tb3gs2.mp3","text":"在~这~里~哦","alt":"voice_cn/char_124_kroos/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e5/90nrdxc1auvql3392t7dyw38w89nlyj.mp3","text":"瞄准~！","alt":"voice_cn/char_124_kroos/cn_027.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e9/jvf8c81gt1as9lxprib346mhytsvt57.mp3","text":"呼~好辛苦啊......","alt":"voice_cn/char_124_kroos/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5e/l2yloiehunjpqt4q45rdfdy9oq94yav.mp3","text":"我觉得还可以哦！","alt":"voice_cn/char_124_kroos/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:6/67/57yi2bzn2jna6cdhh8wa5jsfnutgm61.mp3","text":"嗯，稍微有点遗憾......","alt":"voice_cn/char_124_kroos/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a2/o0qldffb5ehjjv40wydx7lo935hjl27.mp3","text":"对、对不起......下次我会更加努力的......！","alt":"voice_cn/char_124_kroos/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8b/hbgbo318pd3g95rfd7uzx4azi4pvmpg.mp3","text":"在这里能睡个好觉吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_124_kroos/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:8/83/b4x35nex5zkbz7stee06asjn6nfsp7g.mp3","text":"呼......","alt":"voice_cn/char_124_kroos/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:d/db/5s8y4p8tg0uuefirtqpgaho8xb55te2.mp3","te